  "description": "The Britt Chiangmai is a premium real estate development on ~48,000 sqm, envisioned as a modern‑British style enclave in Chiang Mai. It features a mix of pool villas, single houses, twin‑houses, and shop‑houses across 138 units. Thoughtfully designed with communal garden, community square, clubhouse (pool, sauna, gym, lounge, restaurant, guest rooms), and 24‑hour security, it blends classical elegance with modern living and Chiang Mai’s climate context. The architecture emphasizes high ceilings (3 m), full‑glass garages, layered interiors, and lush English‑style gardens to project a bold yet refined identity—the last legacy estate in downtown Chiang Mai.",
